   "cooked": "<p>Here is our updated Gravity Audit! Please help us be accountable and transparent for the best management of the projects in the community. If something doesn’t match the work we are doing, please give feedback to improve.</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/juankbell\">@Juankbell</a> filled this checklist for Gravity</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox googledocs\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tq7H2JekhElUEdfzsTLQ93aSRR_vfC_RcJfODefgOZs/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">docs.google.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tq7H2JekhElUEdfzsTLQ93aSRR_vfC_RcJfODefgOZs/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"googledocs-onebox-logo g-sheets-logo\"></span></a>\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tq7H2JekhElUEdfzsTLQ93aSRR_vfC_RcJfODefgOZs/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">gravity audit</a></h3>\n<p>General Process\n\nGeneral Process\nFor the audit to be successful, the working groups will prepare the documentation needed to fulfill the audit criteria/checklist. The WG will then answer the audit criteria/checklist and get feedback from members...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
